B.Um=new A.mg("Mind-Reading Filter Analysis","Identify and clear the subjective filters that cause you to over-analyze tones, emojis, and hidden meanings in communication.",'In cognitive psychology, "mind-reading" is a distortion where we assume we know someone else\'s intentions without direct facts. When vulnerable, we project our internal insecurities onto their short replies or silence, often mistaking a neutral tone for coldness or rejection. Recognizing these cognitive filters allows you to separate subjective imagination from reality, instantly reducing emotional overthinking.',B.NY,B.MZ,"Cognitive Bias Test",!1,"")
B.NE=s(["Answer 6 concise questions about your texting frequency, recharge habits, and boundaries.","Compare your results in real-time to spot where your default relationship styles align or differ.","Get tailored Co-op insights to understand each other's emotional bottom lines and navigate future disagreements smoothly."],t.s)
