B.Un=new A.mg("Real-World Signal Capture","Step away from screen filters to evaluate their real-world actions, effort, and consistency, reducing confusion from mixed signals.","Relationship psychology indicates that over-analyzing text messages often blinds us to how someone actually behaves in real life. When sweet words online do not match offline actions, it creates cognitive dissonance and severe self-doubt. By tracking concrete real-world investments\u2014like planning dates, dedicating quality time, and social integration\u2014you ground yourself in facts and break free from the inner haze.",B.Mp,B.NU,"Objective Check",!1,"")
